---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<BaseLayout
  title="BarePDF Manifesto: A Small Refusal"
  description="A personal statement by Efe Arabacı for quiet, local, user-first PDF reading."
  currentPath={`${baseUrl}/manifesto`}
  ogImage={`${baseUrl}/images/manifesto-cover.png`}
>
  <article class="manifesto-shell">
    <div class="manifesto-container">
      <section class="manifesto-hero" aria-labelledby="manifesto-title">
        <div class="manifesto-hero-copy">
          <p class="manifesto-kicker" data-i18n data-en="A STATEMENT FROM EFE ARABACI" data-tr="EFE ARABACI'DAN BİR AÇIKLAMA">A STATEMENT FROM EFE ARABACI</p>
          <h1 id="manifesto-title" data-i18n
            data-en="I built BarePDF for the part of you that just wants to read."
            data-tr="BarePDF'i yalnızca okumak isteyen yanınız için geliştirdim.">
            I built BarePDF for the part of you that just wants to read.
          </h1>
          <p class="manifesto-lead" data-i18n
            data-en="A document should not become a pretext for a platform. Opening a PDF should not require a ceremony, an account, a cloud, or a subscription to a company that mistakes your attention for property."
            data-tr="Bir belge bir bulut platformunun bahanesi haline gelmemelidir. Bir PDF açmak bir tören, hesap kaydı, bulut bağlantısı veya dikkatinizi kendi mülkü sanan bir şirkete ödeme gerektirmemelidir.">
            A document should not become a pretext for a platform. Opening a PDF should not require a ceremony, an account, a cloud, or a subscription to a company that mistakes your attention for property.
          </p>
          <a class="manifesto-link" href="#the-refusal">
            <span data-i18n data-en="Read the architectural refusal" data-tr="Mimari ret metnini oku">Read the architectural refusal</span> ↓
          </a>
        </div>

        <figure class="manifesto-art">
          <img src={`${baseUrl}/images/manifesto-cover.png`} alt="A visual representation of reading simplicity vs platform extraction." width="1024" height="1536" />
          <figcaption data-i18n
            data-en="Between convenience and custody, the reader remains."
            data-tr="Kolaylık ile gözetim arasında, okur yerinde kalır.">
            Between convenience and custody, the reader remains.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </section>

      <div class="manifesto-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <section class="manifesto-grid" id="the-refusal">
        <div class="manifesto-prose">
          <p class="manifesto-index">01 / THE KINGDOM OF SOFTWARE</p>
          <h2 data-i18n data-en="Techno-feudalism, now with frictionless onboarding." data-tr="Tekno-feodalizm, şimdi pürüzsüz karşılama ekranlarıyla.">
            Techno-feudalism, now with frictionless onboarding.
          </h2>
          <p data-i18n
            data-en="We have entered an age where a handful of platforms rent tools that used to be ordinary objects. They collect telemetry at the gate, request logins before displaying local files, and label that dependence convenience. The castle is often a dashboard. The tax is often an unsolicited notification."
            data-tr="Bir avuç platformun eskiden sıradan birer araç olan nesneleri bize kiraladığı bir döneme girdik. Kapıda veri topluyor, yerel dosyalarımızı göstermek için oturum açmamızı istiyor ve bu bağımlılığı kolaylık olarak adlandırıyorlar. Kale çoğunlukla bir gösterge paneli, vergi ise istenmeyen bir bildirimdir.">
            We have entered an age where a handful of platforms rent tools that used to be ordinary objects. They collect telemetry at the gate, request logins before displaying local files, and label that dependence convenience. The castle is often a dashboard. The tax is often an unsolicited notification.
          </p>

          <p class="manifesto-index">02 / BARE MEANS ENOUGH</p>
          <h2 data-i18n data-en="A quiet reader is an intentional engineering stance." data-tr="Sessiz bir okuyucu, bilinçli bir mühendislik tavrıdır.">
            A quiet reader is an intentional engineering stance.
          </h2>
          <p data-i18n
            data-en="BarePDF opens documents locally. No mandatory account. No cloud dependency. No tracking disguised as helpfulness. No advertising placed into the margins. Update checks are strictly opt-in. The reader spends resources strictly on the page, not on a feature parade designed to justify monthly subscriptions."
            data-tr="BarePDF belgeleri yerel olarak açar. Zorunlu hesap yok. Bulut bağımlılığı yok. Yardımseverlik maskesi takmış takip mekanizmaları yok. Kenar boşluklarına sıkıştırılmış reklamlar yok. Güncelleme denetimleri tamamen isteğe bağlıdır. Okuyucu kaynaklarını sayfa için harcar, aylık abonelikleri meşrulaştırmak için tasarlanan gösterişli özellikler için değil.">
            BarePDF opens documents locally. No mandatory account. No cloud dependency. No tracking disguised as helpfulness. No advertising placed into the margins. Update checks are strictly opt-in. The reader spends resources strictly on the page, not on a feature parade designed to justify monthly subscriptions.
          </p>

          <p class="manifesto-index">03 / THE DELIBERATE REFUSAL</p>
          <h2 data-i18n data-en="Less theater. Genuine ownership." data-tr="Daha az tiyatro. Gerçek mülkiyet.">
            Less theater. Genuine ownership.
          </h2>
          <p data-i18n
            data-en="There will be no loyalty points for opening a file, no badges for browsing a settings panel, and no cloud-shaped wall built around local storage. Reading is not a social network. BarePDF leaves room for the document, the machine, and the human being reading."
            data-tr="Bir dosya açtığınız için sadakat puanı verilmeyecek, ayarlar menüsünü gezdiğiniz için rozet dağıtılmayacak ve yerel depolamanın etrafına bulut biçimli duvarlar örülmeyecektir. Okuma eylemi bir sosyal ağ değildir. BarePDF yalnızca belgeye, makineye ve okuyan insana yer bırakır.">
            There will be no loyalty points for opening a file, no badges for browsing a settings panel, and no cloud-shaped wall built around local storage. Reading is not a social network. BarePDF leaves room for the document, the machine, and the human being reading.
          </p>
        </div>

        <aside class="manifesto-aside" aria-label="Manifesto summary">
          <div class="manifesto-stamp">BAREPDF<br />OFFLINE BY DEFAULT</div>
          <blockquote data-i18n
            data-en="“You are not the product. You are the person who opened the file. That is enough.”"
            data-tr="“Siz ürün değilsiniz. Siz dosyayı açan insansınız. Bu tek başına yeterlidir.”">
            “You are not the product. You are the person who opened the file. That is enough.”
          </blockquote>
          <p class="manifesto-signature">Efe Arabacı</p>
        </aside>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .manifesto-shell {
    --manifesto-bg: #0f1012;
    --manifesto-surface: #16171a;
    --manifesto-text: #f3f4f6;
    --manifesto-muted: #a3a6b2;
    --manifesto-accent: #f2861c;
    background: var(--manifesto-bg);
    color: var(--manifesto-text);
    min-height: calc(100vh - 72px);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .manifesto-container {
    width: min(1160px, 100% - 3rem);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(3.5rem, 6vw, 6.5rem) 0;
  }

  .manifesto-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(280px, 0.9fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 6rem);
  }

  .manifesto-hero-copy {
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .manifesto-kicker,
  .manifesto-index {
    color: var(--manifesto-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .manifesto-hero h1 {
    color: var(--manifesto-text);
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .manifesto-lead {
    color: var(--manifesto-muted);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.5vw, 1.25rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .manifesto-link {
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--manifesto-accent);
    color: var(--manifesto-text);
    display: inline-flex;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .manifesto-link:hover {
    color: var(--manifesto-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .manifesto-art {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 420px;
    justify-self: end;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid #2e3037;
  }

  .manifesto-art img {
    aspect-ratio: 2 / 3;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .manifesto-art figcaption {
    color: var(--manifesto-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    background-color: var(--manifesto-surface);
  }

  .manifesto-rule {
    background: var(--manifesto-accent);
    height: 1px;
    margin: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem) 0 clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    opacity: 0.4;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .manifesto-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(240px, 0.65fr);
  }

  .manifesto-prose {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .manifesto-prose .manifesto-index:not(:first-child) {
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
  }

  .manifesto-prose h2 {
    color: var(--manifesto-text);
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.5vw, 2.2rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .manifesto-prose p:not(.manifesto-index) {
    color: var(--manifesto-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .manifesto-aside {
    align-self: start;
    background: var(--manifesto-surface);
    border: 1px solid #2e3037;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--manifesto-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2rem;
    position: sticky;
    top: 7rem;
  }

  .manifesto-stamp {
    color: var(--manifesto-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .manifesto-aside blockquote {
    color: var(--manifesto-text);
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .manifesto-signature {
    color: var(--manifesto-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .manifesto-hero,
    .manifesto-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .manifesto-art {
      justify-self: start;
      max-width: 360px;
    }

    .manifesto-aside {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
